grammes in a fast-moving GTM, sales or commercial environment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong facilitation and presentation skills, with the confidence to lead live sessions, engage different audiences and make complex topics clear and actionable.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience developing training materials and e-learning content that help people understand and apply new skills.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience building and running team operations, such as OKR and roadmap tracking, and operating rhythms, with the ability to coordinate dependencies across teams and keep many stakeholders aligned..</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience building or maintaining dashboards, trackers and reporting processes, with the ability to use data to measure progress and inform decisions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with learning management systems (LMS), such as WorkRamp, and an understanding of how to manage learning content and track completion.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A strong passion for using AI tools and agents, with hands-on experience applying them to automate repetitive tasks, improve processes and find smarter ways to work.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A creative, curious approach to problem-solving, with the initiative to question existing ways of working and explore better solutions.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Bonus </strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience supporting a company-wide event, such as Sales Kick-Off.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience working at a high-growth technology or AI company.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with Salesforce, Gong or other GTM reporting tools.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Growth Potential</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We believe in hiring the best talent in the world to make an im