rtner with our Design team to make sure every film meets ElevenLabs' bar and brand guidelines.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work alongside subjects of our case studies, many of whom live with a disability, as equals and ensure that the production team does the same. You will build in consent, access needs, and editorial input at every stage to ensure alignment in how the story is told, cut, and shared.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Plan and execute Impact's conferences and activations alongside the Events team, turning each one into an in-person moment that drives real ROI and leaves a lasting impression, with Impact's own storytelling angle built in.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support Comms in telling Impact's story through PR, coordinating with Comms and, when applicable, a PR agency to keep press windows and partner announcements on track, and helping make sure Impact's international stories get told well as the program expands globally.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with Design to keep all video and static collateral on-brand, advocating for a high creative standard and Impact’s lens.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Carry a consistent visual and narrative thread across launches, blog content, and ElevenLabs Summit presentations.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Draft copy for social and blog content, collaborating with Comms to land a final draft, and with Design on all launch-related visual assets.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Manage multiple concurrent launches, shoots, and events at once.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Requirements</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A great project manager with a sharp creative eye, someone who runs cross-functional logistics flawlessly, has real taste, and will push the team to hit it.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven practical experience working with vulnerable communit