minent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $22B - multiples of 11, always.<br /><br />We have expanded from voice into three main platforms:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">Everything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>How we work</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>High-velocity: </strong>Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Impact not job titles: </strong>We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>AI first:</strong> We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Excellence everywhere: </strong>Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Global team: </strong>We prioritize your talent, not your location.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>What we offer</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Innovative culture:</strong> You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Growth paths: </strong>Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Learning &amp; development</strong>: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Social travel</strong>: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Annual team offsite: </strong>Each year, we bring your entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia, Italy and Cancún</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Co-working</strong>: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>About the Role</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re looking for a leader to own our legal operations function and continue building it for our next phase of growth. Working with a dedicated automations engineering team, you will own the systems that ensure the Legal Team scales with the company: contract management, vendor relationships (including outside counsel billing and guidelines) and the overall legal tech stack. The goal is simple: help define what a legal organization looks like in the AI native era.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>In this role, you will:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Assist in the design and improvement of the operating model for Legal. Identify work that should be handled by the team and areas where we can continue automating.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Manage our legal technology stack, including contract lifecycle management (Ironclad), matter management, and creating an e-billing systems</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Manage relationships with outside counsel and legal service providers, including budget and performance tracking</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with our automation teams to use Eleven Agents and other tools to change the way work is done across the team</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Define metrics and build dashboards that give us a clear view of the team's priorities, workload and performance</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with Finance, IT, FDE and business teams to keep legal processes aligned with how the company operates</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Who you are:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are a strategist and an operator. You are incredibly intellectually curious and enjoy breaking down and rebuilding processes</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Highly organized, detail-oriented, and proactive - you’re comfortable juggling multiple priorities while maintaining accuracy</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Genuinely interested in the future of AI and emerging technologies.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A strong communicator who enjoys collaborating with cross-functional teams</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable working independently in a distributed, high-trust environment</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have previous experience at a high-growth technology or AI company</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you bring:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">7+ years of experience in legal operations with some experience leading the function</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Deep expertise in legal technology, including CLM platforms (Ironclad a major plus), e-billing systems, and matter management tools</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience supporting global teams</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong analytical skills with experience gathering metrics to storytell and drive key business decisions</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excellent organizational skills and ability to manage competing deadlines.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Location</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This role is remote and can be executed anywhere in the United States.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are an equal opportunity employer and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, veteran status, disability or other legally protected statuses.</p><hr><p>Compensation: $80K – $130K • Offers Equity</p><ul><li> • $80K – $130K • Offers Equity</li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/elevenlabs/remote-legal-operations-lead-195764","tags":["Legal"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Remote","created_at":1794098411},{"slug":"solutions-consultant-mid-market-dach-munich-14412","company_name":"Notion","title":"Solutions Consultant, Mid-Market, DACH","description":"<h1>Who We Are</h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">Notion is the collaborative AI workspace where teams and agents <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vkpYpWfEK5s">think together</a>. We're building one place where your knowledge, projects, meetings, and AI tools live side by side, so work is faster, clearer, and less fragmented. Millions of individuals, small teams, and large companies run their work on Notion.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Notinos (our employees) are customer zero in bringing this future of work to life. We care about craft, building things that last, and the belief that great work is still fundamentally human. Our goal isn’t to ship the next feature. Each and every team of Notinos is working to set the standard for how humans work together in the AI era. From building a business’s system of record to making and managing AI agents to automating away the busy work, we care deeply about giving our customers more time for their life’s work.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1>About the Role:</h1><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Notion is shaping the future of Go-To-Market, and as a Solutions Consultant (SC), you’ll bring that future to life by building alongside customers and turning their biggest challenges into measurable outcomes. As a customer-facing, quota-carrying SC, you’ll bring together technical fluency and commercial ownership to grow your book of business. You’ll build pipeline with BDRs, engage key stakeholders, lead discovery, co-build workflow solutions live with customers, and guide opportunities through close. You’ll connect each solution to a clear business case and stay engaged through adoption, expansion, and renewal so customers realize the value of what they buy.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll partner with BDRs, Outcomes Architects, and technical or product specialists while maintaining clear ownership of customer relationships, opportunity momentum, and next steps. If you’re a builder who loves to sell—and want to work at the intersection of AI, productivity, and enterprise—this is the role.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This role will be based in Dublin. We work from our offices on Mondays, Tuesdays and Thursdays (our Anchor Days) because we do our best thinking and building together in person. We’re looking for someone who’s excited to work alongside the team during those days.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1>What You'll Achieve:</h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Create pipeline across your book of business.</strong> Build target-account plans with BDRs and initiate outreach to priority stakeholders to generate qualified opportunities, alongside BDR-sourced pipeline.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Own opportunities from first conversation through close.</strong> Lead discovery, qualify business needs and urgency, align stakeholders, shape the solution and business case, and drive the evaluation and commercial decision. Navigate commercial sizing, proposal construction, procurement, legal, and security review to close deals with the right scope, credits, and implementation path.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Design and validate workflow solutions that deliver measurable value.</strong> Map current- and future-state workflows, co-build solutions live in Notion, and define realistic scope, success criteria, and an implementation path. Translate customer needs and validated outcomes into a clear business case, commercial recommendation, and decision path. Treat discovery as an opportunity to build and validate.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Orchestrate the right partners while maintaining ownership.</strong> Engage BDRs, Outcomes Architects, and technical or product specialists at the right moments, with clear context and asks, while owning opportunity momentum, customer communication, and next steps.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Drive customer value and commercial growth after signature.</strong> Partner with Outcomes Architects, guide the initial path to value with a clear adoption plan, on onboarding and ongoing multi-workflow adoption, and own expansion strategy and renewal planning. Stay accountable for translating credits sold into credits consumed, and surface risks or expansion opportunities as customer workflows mature.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1>Skills You'll Need to Bring: </h1><ul style=