lment plans and factoring, and we turn every delivered treatment into a correct invoice and cash in the practice’s account. Because we sit where treatment is planned, we know what it’s worth and whether it is converted before we take on the risk, which no bank or payment provider can do. We earn a share of the revenue we help collect, so the practice’s growth is our growth.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">The domain has two teams. Financial Platform builds the infrastructure that moves money and keeps compliant records of it. Financial Experience builds everything doctors, practice staff, patients and our own teams touch, across the Doctor Portal, Patient Portal and Backoffice.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About Nelly</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are building the AI-Driven Financial Operating System for European healthcare, solving the biggest challenges for patients and practices. We create what no bank or software platform can handle. Our all-in-one platform transforms chaotic administrative processes into intelligent, automated workflows, from patient care to billing to next-generation payments. Because we truly believe: healthcare should be less about paperwork and more about people.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Why? </strong>Because Europe is facing a massive shortage of medical professionals. And if we don't rethink the way practices work, the system won't be able to keep up. With our Series B funding of over €50 million from world-class investors, we are turning our vision into reality.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What sets us apart:</strong> We work with the best team, which is why we give everything together every day. We believe in Talent Density, because exceptional people make everyone around them better. At Nelly, we move fast and expect everyone to keep up. Stagnation isn’t an option, which is why we invest heavily in growth. AI is an essential part of how we work at Nelly. We expect you to use it every day and give you everything you need to do so. You get trust and ownership and we expect you to speak up, even when it's uncomfortable.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Joining us, you will:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead, inspire and grow a high-performing team of 3–6 software engineers</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own hiring for your team, building a team of high-performing engineers</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work closely with your product manager to build, launch and improve the financial journey iteratively. That starts at the point of decision, with cost plans, credit checks and installment plans, and runs through to collection, with invoicing, dunning and the processing of billing files</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the quality, reliability and security of your team's products, delivering highly available production systems that handle sensitive financial and patient data</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with the Financial Platform team to shape the infrastructure your features depend on, and with Nelly's internal teams who use the Backoffice every day.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Keep your team at the cutting edge of LLM- and AI-based engineering, testing new ideas and tools as they're released</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Stay hands-on, developing alongside your team</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Contribute to engineering-wide initiatives as a member of Nelly's engineering leadership team</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you'll bring:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">3+ years as an Engineering Manager and 8+ years of overall experience in software development</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A strong technical background designing, building and owning customer-facing full-stack web applications and the back-end systems behind them, with care for usability and the end-user experience</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A track record of iterating very quickly: defining small scopes to test hypotheses, running A/B tests, measuring impact, and using the results to decide what to build next</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with cloud-native development</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A deep understanding of software engineering processes and team management.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Empathy and excellent communication skills, with product, design and non-technical users alike</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Even better if you have:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with billing, invoicing, payments, lending or other financial products.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience building products for several user groups at once, such as businesses, their staff and their end customers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with healthcare billing, for example in German dental or medical practices</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Our Interview Process:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Recruiter screening, 30 minutes</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hiring manager conversation, 30 minutes</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Product interview, 60 minutes</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Onsite interview - System design, Leadership interview and Meet the CTO</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What we offer:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>The people you get to work with.</strong> You will work alongside the brightest minds we could find, on hard problems, as a team. We take on challenges together and we never forget to have fun doing it.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Room to grow faster than almost anywhere else.</strong> New challenges, more scope, real ownership from day one. We trust you to own it and to speak up when something is wrong. Just do not expect to stand still.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A yearly learning and development budget</strong>, plus the coaching, feedback and internal knowledge that actually move you forward. Real investment in your learning. </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A front row seat while we build something big.</strong> We are building the financial operating system for European healthcare, with AI woven into how we build, sell and support. Real scope, real impact.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Deutschlandticket</strong> or <strong>Swapfiets</strong> membership, so you get around the city fast.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Urban Sports Club membership</strong>, for sport and balance.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Flexible working hours and a<strong> hybrid setup.</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Up to 4 weeks of <strong>workation.</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A <strong>dog friendly office</strong> with great vibes and a team that is fun to work with.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">We welcome applications from people of all genders and backgrounds, regardless of origin or age. If you're convinced you're the right fit for this role - even if your CV doesn't match the requirements 100% - tell us why.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/nelly-solutions/senior-engineering-manager-financial-experience-berlin-491031","tags":["Engineering"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1794087612},{"slug":"founding-customer-success-manager-dach-berlin-249508","company_name":"Heidi","title":"Founding Customer Success Manager - DACH","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re Heidi.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're building the future of healthcare by giving every clinician the earth's finest AI Care Partner. Our platform has absorbed the administrative chaos of 175 million patient visits and supported 67 million clinical hours. Today, we support 2.8 million patient sessions a week across 190+ countries, in 110 languages and over 200 specialties.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Healthcare systems are failing us; clinicians spend more time on documentation than on patients, and the human connection that makes medicine worth practicing is eroding. Our mission is simple: double the world’s capacity for care and strengthen the human connection at its heart.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We found product-market fit with a freemium medical scribe that clinicians love. Now, we're expanding. Every task a clinician hands to Heidi is a patient who feels more attended to, a health system unclogged, and a clinician who gets to be a clinician again.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’ve grown annual recurring revenue from $1 million to $50 million in two years.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">To go further, we’ve secured US$340 million: a $100 million Series C led by Blackbird, with Phoenix Court, Point72 Private Investments and Headline, alongside a $240 million growth investment led by General Catalyst’s Customer Value Fund.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">If you want to join us in doing work worth shipping, jump in.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em><strong>The role</strong></em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">As a Customer Success Manager at Heidi Health, you’ll be the bridge between technology and care - helping hospitals, clinics, and clinicians across Germany adopt and love Heidi.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll manage the full customer journey for both public and private hospital deployments, ensuring seamless implementation, strong clinician engagement, and measurable impact on patient care.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br />This role is ideal for someone with a medical background (e.g. former doctor, nurse, or allied health professional) who’s excited to drive digital transformation in healthcare.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em><strong>What you’ll do</strong></em></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Own customer outcomes:</strong> Be the strategic partner for a portfolio of Heidi’s customers, ensuring they achieve measurable success and realise value.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Lead onboarding &amp; training:</strong> Lead onboarding of new customers from planning, training through to go-live, delivering seamless integrations into customer workflows.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Track and improve metrics along customer journey like time-to-first-value and early activation.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Drive strategic adoption:</strong> Develop and execute tailored adoption plans to maximise user engagement and satisfaction, enhancing the continued love for Heidi among clinicians.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Enhance Retention &amp; Growth:</strong> Identify expansion opportunities, mitigate churn risks and work cross-functionally to deepen product engagement.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Customer advocacy:</strong> Build executive-level relationships and become the voice of the customer internally, advocating for their needs and priorities and showcasing wins.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Continuous engagement: </strong>Deliver value at every touchpoint through proactive check-ins, success planning, and education strategies. Think and act strategically to scale your impact.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Resolve operational blockers:</strong> Collaborate with product, engineering, and support teams to ensure a smooth customer experience.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Feedback insights:</strong> Gather and share insights to influence product development and feature prioritisation.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em><strong>What you'll need</strong></em></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">2+ years in a customer success role at a SaaS company, with proven ability to own the full lifecycle</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A romantic streak about software. You believe great products can transform someone's day.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with Germany’s healthcare ecosystem (both public and private).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Exceptional communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to effortlessly set and manage expectations with customers and cross-functional teams.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Highly organised and can confidently manage multiple projects and competing priorities, while maintaining attention to detail and quality.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Self-starter with a bias for action, comfortable navigating fast-paced and ambiguous environments.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Passion for AI, shown through hands-on building, prototyping, or side projects.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You default to building over requesting.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You're confident in your thinking and open to being wrong. Great ideas win regardless of who surfaces them.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Attitude is more important than experience - if you are hungry, competitive, and motivated, with a knack for problem solving and relationship-building, we want to hear from you.<br /></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em><strong>How we show up</strong></em></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Build for the next decade, not next quarter</strong>. Our targets are outrageous on purpose. The world's health doesn't have the luxury of incrementalism.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Lead, don't wait</strong>. We treat tomorrow's problems today. Sometimes we build what's needed before it's wanted, and we're fine with that.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Follow the evidence</strong>. Trust the patient. We pursue truth relentlessly. But when the subjective and objective disagree, we treat the patient, not the numbers. Ego is a comorbidity we can't afford.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Own the outcome</strong>. Everyone here carries the company. Raise problems with solutions, solve them end-to-end, and never be a bystander.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Ship, measure, go again</strong>. A button today, a workflow tomorrow. More iterations beat better planning. We're precise at pace, not reckless.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Live in clinicians' reality</strong>. Not the ideal workflow, the twenty-patients-before-lunch actual one. We build for exhausted humans, and we'd better be decent ones while we do it.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em><strong>Why Heidi?</strong></em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll join a team measured on real-world impact, not press cycles. We live and breathe the challenges of modern health systems, and are laser-focused on exacting the change we’d like to see. We’re medicos, engineers, builders and designers who’ve felt (on every side of the equation) what non-care feels like, the moral and practical toll as a provider or receiver.<br /></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Building what we’re building isn’t always easy. Standard tech playbooks routinely fail in healthcare, and the friction of the medical system will test your perseverance. But we didn’t choose easy, we chose a purpose-driven mission that actually matters. We hold ourselves to a higher standard because healthcare demands it. If you join Heidi, you recognize that the deeper question isn’t whether AI can solve the global healthcare crisis, but whose hands will shape it.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">True A-players progress extremely fast here. The nature of the scale-up game is demanding, but we value sustainable performance and mental health. You're trusted to perform, and you set your schedule. We operate on outcomes &gt; inputs, not process theatre. We all take the bins out, metaphorically and literally.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br /></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em><strong>We take care of you.</strong><br /></em>We chose to open-source our <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://app.notion.com/p/heidihealth/Benefits-Hub-356ca630286e80b1927cd275a206fa58?source=copy_link"><u>benefits hub</u></a>, if you care to take a peek.</p><hr><p>Compensation: €70K – €85K • Offers Equity • + OTE</p><ul><li>Pave P3 - CSM DACH • Base Salary  + OTE €70K – €85K • Offers Equity • + OTE</li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/heidi/founding-customer-success-manager-dach-berlin-249508","tags":["GTM"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1794087612},{"slug":"ausbildung-zur-medizinischen-fachangestellten-bottrop-eigen-70556","company_name":"PraxisEins","title":"Ausbildung zur Medizinischen Fachangestellten (m/w/d)","description":"<h2><strong>DEIN START BEI PRAXISEINS.</strong> </h2><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Lust auf einen Beruf, bei dem Du Menschen helfen kannst und gleichzeitig medizinisch gefordert bist? </strong>Dann starte Deine Zukunft in unserer modernen Praxis! </p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Werde Teil einer solchen Praxis und beginne die Ausbildung zur Medizinischen Fachangestellten (MFA) (m/w/d) in unserer Praxis. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du bist bereit, mit uns die Gesundheitsbranche zu transformieren und fit für die Zukunft zu machen? Du magst den Patientenkontakt und kannst gut mit dem Telefon umgehen? Du bist bereit, fleißig für deine Ausbildung zu lernen? Dann sind wir der richtige Arbeitgeber für Dich! Werde Teil unseres Teams! </p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>WAS WIR DIR BIETEN</strong> </h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Umfangreiche fachliche sowie überfachliche Ausbildung </p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Raum für Kreativität und Eigeninitiative </p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Moderne, attraktive Praxis, die zum Austausch einlädt und das Wohlbefinden fördert </p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Junges, dynamisches Team, das etwas bewegen will </p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Faire Vergütung </p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>DEINE AUFGABEN</strong> </h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du unterstützt im Praxisalltag am Empfang, im Labor und bei der Behandlung </p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du unterstützt bei der Dokumentation in unserer Netzwerkpraxis </p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du unterstützt das Recall-Management und Patiententelefon </p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du unterstützt beim Beschaffungsmanagement </p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>DEIN PROFIL</strong> </h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bei uns zählen Charakter und Menschlichkeit ebenso wie Skills &amp; Erfahrung. Auch wenn Du nicht alle Punkte des Anforderungsprofils erfüllst, bitten wir Dich, uns Deine Bewerbung zu senden. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Um Teil unseres Teams zu werden, bringst Du idealerweise mit: </p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Mindestens guter Hauptschulabschluss </p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Sehr gute Kenntnisse der deutschen Sprache, mind. C1 </p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lebensfrohe und offene Natur </p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Verantwortungsbewusstes und respektvolles Auftreten </p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hohes Maß an Selbstorganisation und Zuverlässigkeit </p></li></ul><h1><strong>Über PraxisEins</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">PraxisEins ist ein staatlich unterstützter Gesundheitsversorger mit einem Fokus auf den Bereichen der hausärztlichen Versorgung, Diabetologie und Schmerztherapie.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>Unsere Mission</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">Versorgung sichern - Qualitätsmedizin gewährleisten. Als PraxisEins wollen wir die Primärversorgung zukunftsfähig machen – mit digitaler Unterstützung, klaren Prozessen und einem Umfeld, in dem Ärztinnen und Ärzte Medizin wieder mit Freude ausüben können!<br /><em><br />PraxisEins ist ein Arbeitgeber, der Chancengleichheit fördert und Vielfalt schätzt. Wir freuen uns über alle Bewerbungen und bearbeiten diese völlig unabhängig von Geschlecht, Religionszugehörigkeit, Hautfarbe, Herkunft, sexueller Orientierung, Alter, Familienstand oder Behindertenstatus. Zur besseren Lesbarkeit wird in dieser Stellenanzeige das generische Maskulinum verwendet.</em></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/praxiseins/ausbildung-zur-medizinischen-fachangestellten-bottrop-eigen-70556","tags":["MFA"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Bottrop-Eigen","created_at":1794087612},{"slug":"working-student-project-management-and-construction-all-genders-berlin-388754","company_name":"Q Energy","title":"Working Student - Project management and Construction (all genders)","description":"<p>Q ENERGY is Europe’s 360° green energy company. Together with our more than 500 employees we develop, build, and manage renewable energy assets across the entire value chain of large-scale renewable energy projects – from solar, to onshore wind and offshore wind, to energy storage and hybrid power plants. With a pipeline of more than 11 GW we are among the leading renewable energy companies in Europe. We are always on the lookout for people who want to work with us to empower a sustainable world with green energy. &nbsp;</p><p></p><p>We are looking for a motivated and detail-oriented <strong>Working Student</strong> to support the successful delivery of utility-scale renewable energy projects from development through construction and into operational handover.</p><p></p><p>Working closely with experienced Project Managers, you will gain broad exposure to the entire project lifecycle, supporting the planning, coordination, execution, and commercial management of complex solar PV, battery storage, wind, and other renewable energy infrastructure projects. This role is an excellent opportunity for engineering students who are passionate about the energy transition and aspire to build a career in project management within the renewable energy sector.</p><p></p><p>Your responsibilities:</p><p>You will join our project management team and support the delivery of EPC construction projects. The role is broad. You won’t be expected to cover everything below. Your tasks will depend on your background, interests, and experience, and you’ll grow into more areas over time.</p><p></p><p>Depending on your focus, you may support us with:</p><p></p><p>Planning and project controls:</p><ul><li>Developing and implementing project execution plans, schedules, budgets, quality plans, reporting structures, and risk management plans</li><li>Tracking project progress against key milestones and KPIs, identifying risks, issues, delays, and cost impacts, and helping implement mitigation measures</li><li>Monitoring project costs, forecasts, cash flow, invoice verification, and budget performance</li><li>The invoice payment process and internal approvals</li></ul><p></p><p>Contracts and commercial management</p><ul><li>Administering the main EPC contract with clients and monitoring compliance with contractual obligations, rights, and responsibilities</li><li>Ensuring contractual requirements are reflected in procurement activities, subcontract agreements, project strategies, and execution plans</li><li>Managing contractual claims, variation orders, and commercial negotiations with clients and subcontractors</li><li>Technical evaluations and the selection of EPC subcontractors, suppliers, consultants, and specialized service providers</li></ul><p></p><p>Delivery and coordination</p><ul><li>Coordinating engineering, procurement, quality assurance, permitting, construction, commissioning, and handover activities</li><li>Ensuring permitting requirements, grid connection requirements, environmental obligations, and technical specifications are incorporated into project planning and execution</li><li>Managing technical interfaces between contractors, suppliers, utilities, clients, and other project stakeholders</li><li>Coordinating project activities to ensure timely delivery and a smooth transition into Operations &amp; Maintenance (O&amp;M)</li></ul><p><strong>Requirements</strong></p><ul><li>Currently enrolled in a Bachelor’s or Master’s program in one of the following fields: Electrical Engineering, Mechanical Engineering, Civil Engineering, Energy Systems Engineering, or a related technical discipline</li><li>Advanced German (at least B2) and good command of English</li><li>Good knowledge of MS Office (especially Excel, Word, and PowerPoint)</li><li>Genuine interest in renewable energy and project management</li><li>Structured, detail-oriented, and proactive way of working</li></ul><p><strong>Benefits</strong></p><p>We value our employees and offer a comprehensive benefits package, including:</p><p></p><ul><li><strong>Our workplace: </strong>Located in a modern and sustainable office building just a few steps from Südkreuz station, making it easily accessible for all employees.</li><li><strong>IT Equipment:</strong> We’ll set you up with a laptop, monitor, headphones, and, if needed, a company phone.</li><li><strong>Work-Life Balance: </strong>we value your personal time. Enjoy the flexibility to choose your work hours, so you can prioritize what matters most—whether it’s attending a workout class, handling personal matters, or starting your weekend a little earlier. You’re in control.</li><li><strong>Mobile Working: </strong>At Q ENERGY we offer a hybrid work model: three days in the office and two days of mobile working. This setup supports in-person teamwork while also allowing for more flexibility and reduced commuting.</li><li><strong>Spendit Card:</strong> €25 monthly allowance on top of your monthly salary, which can be used for your daily lunch or can be saved up unlimitedly.</li><li><strong>Public Transport Allowance:</strong> Enjoy a €15 monthly contribution to your BVG ticket—making your commute easier and more affordable!</li><li><strong>Generous Vacation Policy:</strong> Enjoy a well-deserved break and take 30 vacation days a year plus two special leave days, giving you 32 days total to relax, recharge, and explore!</li><li><strong>Onboarding:</strong> We provide a detailed onboarding process to ensure you have a smooth and successful start with us, helping you feel supported and prepared from day one.</li><li><strong>Insurance Coverage:</strong> With accident and life insurance included, we’ve got you covered, giving you peace of mind on and off the job.</li><li><strong>Corporate Discounts:</strong> Employees get access to exclusive offers and discounts for various brands through our Corporate Benefits program.</li><li><strong>Corporate Health Management: </strong>Prioritize your well-being with our corporate health management program, including preventive check-ups to keep you at your best!</li><li><strong>Mutual support:</strong>  You’ll thrive in a supportive environment where open communication, teamwork, and knowledge sharing are highly valued. We’re committed to your growth, encouraging your professional and personal development through ongoing support and guidance.</li></ul><p></p><p>Then we look forward to receiving your application. Please let us know your salary expectations and your earliest possible starting date.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please note: We do not accept applications by email. Please use the "Apply for this Job" button for your application. Thank you very much!  &nbsp;<br>  &nbsp;<br>If you have any questions, please contact our Recruiting team ----- ENERGY is an internationally operating company - at our company, people from many nations, cultures, and locations work together in partnership and exchange their experiences and values with each other in an open and collegial manner.   &nbsp;</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/q-energy/working-student-project-management-and-construction-all-genders-berlin-388754","tags":["Germany Division"],"job_types":[],"location":"Berlin, Germany","created_at":1794086417},{"slug":"senior-analytics-engineer-finance-426148","company_name":"mewssystems","title":"Senior Analytics Engineer - Finance","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help make the world more hospitable &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hospitality industry is uniquely human, and it deserves technology that’s just as inspiring as the people behind it. At Mews, we’re transforming the industry with a platform that helps hotels run smarter, move faster and create better guest experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do. You’ll have autonomy and the trust to make good decisions and move quickly. And you’ll enjoy a real sense of purpose as you see the impact of what we’re building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re motivated by ownership, curiosity and meaningful impact, and are driven to deliver consistent high performance, you’ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&#39;s get into the specifics. It’s impossible to capture every nuance of a role – especially at a rapidly growing company like Mews – but if we had to distil it into a job description (which we do because this is a job description), it would be this:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11&quot; data-local-id=&quot;93795b139292&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Analytics Engineer to lead the data architecture behind our most business-critical financial work: billing, regulatory reporting (&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;EMI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;SOX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; compliance, financial forecasting and executive reporting. You&#39;ll design the data solutions that finance, payments and audit teams depend on, set the standards for how analytics work ships, and mentor others on the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;400&quot; data-local-id=&quot;04e5a5743e87&quot;&gt;This is a shape-the-team role. You&#39;ll have real influence over how we work, what we build and the pace we move at. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We expect you to use AI fluently where it adds leverage in modeling, code review and debugging, and to apply clear judgment on where it doesn&#39;t.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;663&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8a127a4eec79&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;69983cc5-7a69-4c5e-8cb0-2d1476fbd536&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;683&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f86dd91255b3&quot;&gt;Lead the architecture and development of high-impact data models in dbt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;759&quot; data-local-id=&quot;637843ae65c8&quot;&gt;Architect data solutions across business-critical financial workflows, including billing, regulatory reporting (&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;EMI&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;SOX&lt;/span&gt; compliance, financial forecasting and executive reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;943&quot; data-local-id=&quot;328036a130de&quot;&gt;Mentor analytics engineers and review code to uphold standards across the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1026&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3cadb74519a9&quot;&gt;Find and fix performance bottlenecks across the data stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1089&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ea6a753ebf9a&quot;&gt;Translate business problems into clean, efficient data solutions in close partnership with stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1197&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6ac1ef55faf8&quot;&gt;Set team-wide standards for documentation, CI/CD, observability and testing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1277&quot; data-local-id=&quot;84f45985e13a&quot;&gt;Set the team&#39;s norms for where AI belongs in our workflow, from model development to code review, and where human oversight stays non-negotiable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1426&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bfbd44915343&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;31d514bd-be3b-41a0-8411-e3530a1faabd&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1442&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ebab218e4ac8&quot;&gt;5+ years in analytics engineering or a similar role, with a track record of designing data models that hold up to cross-functional use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1581&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cf5dc9cd98d7&quot;&gt;Deep, hands-on expertise with dbt, SQL and Python on a modern data platform (Databricks or equivalent).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1688&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5907f55d915c&quot;&gt;Strong grasp of pipeline orchestration, testing frameworks and the practices that keep them healthy at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1801&quot; data-local-id=&quot;766324799f66&quot;&gt;Comfortable setting technical direction, mentoring engineers and working closely with finance, payments and audit stakeholders. You can explain a trade-off clearly and influence the decision that follows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2009&quot; data-local-id=&quot;94d52040e4ec&quot;&gt;You use AI hands-on in your day-to-day technical work and can show specific examples of how it has changed the way you build, review or debug data models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2167&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d29af94c37b5&quot;&gt;You catch AI&#39;s errors before anything ships, including hallucinations, overconfident answers and plausible-but-wrong code, and you have a clear sense of where human oversight stays non-negotiable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Spain&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€65.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€85.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Czechia&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 008 000 Kč&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 320 000 Kč CZK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;UK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£60,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£72,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;France&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€54.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€65.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary ranges are provided in good faith and reflect current market conditions and internal pay structures. Final compensation may be adjusted based on funding, budget constraints, or exceptional candidate qualifications, but will remain within reasonable proximity to the stated range.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary disclosure is provided in compliance with applicable pay transparency legislation. We are committed to equal pay practices and prohibit salary history inquiries during our recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If the location you&#39;re applying from wasn&#39;t originally advertised for this role, salary range information is available upon request at any point during the application/interview process - your recruiter will be able to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our success is powered by our incredible people, supported by benefits that help them thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No matter where you’re based, you’ll enjoy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid holiday (yes, really)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in our company share program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave (6 months fully paid for primary caregivers, 2 months for secondary, available after one year of service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual Learning budget of €300 (and more for high performers) to support your development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly &quot;EDGE&quot; time to Explore, Develop, Grow, and Elevate yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work from anywhere policy with flexibility to work abroad for a few weeks each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation options, available after one year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, hybrid working options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A home office setup budget to make your workspace your own and a monthly work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Claude tokens, so you can automate workflows and build smarter, more efficient ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll receive additional benefits that vary by location, from healthcare and retirement plans to team events, socials and other perks. Ask us about it during your interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunities employer. We value teams that reflect the diversity of the customers and communities we serve. Different perspectives make better ideas, stronger products and a more welcoming company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also believe transparency is important when deciding if you&#39;re the right fit. Mews is an ambitious, high-pressure environment of continuous learning and high standards. Success here requires resilience, adaptability and a willingness to solve difficult problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few things that define how we work:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High autonomy means high responsibility. People are expected to take ownership and drive outcomes. There isn’t a detailed playbook for everything, and that’s part of what makes the work challenging – and rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change is constant. We’re growing quickly and adapting as we scale. Teams, processes and priorities continue to evolve, and only people who stay curious and agile will thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re remote-first, not relationship-free. Flexibility is core to how we work, but strong relationships still matter. Our teams are global, so we need expert collaborators and communicators to help us move forward together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI is an integral part of our processes. It’s not here to steal people’s jobs, but to amplify efficiency and productivity. We’re motivated to proactively use the technology to seek out better ways of working and share our findings with the rest of the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there&#39;s anything we can do to support you during the application process, let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, nationality, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One final thing: don&#39;t hold back. If you don&#39;t meet 100% of the criteria in this job description but you&#39;re certain you could make a big impact, apply. Everyone should have equal access to opportunities, and we&#39;re committed to providing an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If Mews sounds like the kind of environment where you&#39;d thrive, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/mewssystems/senior-analytics-engineer-finance-426148","tags":["Operations"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1794077723},{"slug":"regional-director-of-sales-munich-282413","company_name":"RobCo","title":"Regional Director of Sales","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About the Role at RobCo</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">RobCo is building the category of Autonomous Industrial Robotics and we're doing it fast. We believe that automating the ordinary frees humans to do the extraordinary, and we're building the end-to-end robotics infrastructure to make that possible - hardware, software, and AI in one stack that just works. </p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">As our Regional Director of Enterprise Sales, you act as the primary catalyst for RobCo's enterprise growth across the German market, driving large-scale industrial adoption of our Autonomous Manufacturing Platform. You will lead high-impact sales strategies, build strategic relationships with executive stakeholders in key industrial sectors, and scale our enterprise footprint from the ground up.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Your Responsibilities</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive Regional Revenue: Lead and execute the German enterprise sales strategy to achieve and exceed ambitious revenue and market-penetration targets.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build Executive Relationships: Target, engage, and secure long-term partnerships with C-level executives and key decision-makers across mid-market and large-scale manufacturing and industrial enterprises.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Champion Technical Solutions: Direct complex, multi-stakeholder enterprise sales cycles by clearly communicating the strategic, financial, and technical ROI of RobCo's modular robotics and physical AI solutions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Scale Enterprise Footprint: Identify and unlock new market verticals and geographic opportunities across the DACH region to continually expand the sales pipeline.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner Cross-Functionally: Collaborate closely with Solution Engineering and Product teams to align client requirements with product capabilities and deliver seamless rollouts.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Forecast with Accuracy: Maintain meticulous pipeline hygiene, actionable sales reporting, and highly accurate quarterly/annual revenue forecasts in Salesforce.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Represent the Brand: Position RobCo as the premier AI-driven automation provider through representation at key industry events, panel discussions, and executive roundtables.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Team Leadership &amp; Enablement: Lead, mentor, and coach a high-performing team of Senior Account Executives, driving quota attainment, pipeline growth, and continuous performance management.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>We're looking for someone who has:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Degree in Business Administration, Engineering, Industrial Management, or comparable experience.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven track record of sales leadership, with demonstrated success enabling Senior Account Executives to consistently achieve and exceed revenue targets.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Several years of experience in Enterprise SaaS or Hardware/Robotics Sales, specifically closing complex, high-value B2B deals within the German industrial or manufacturing sectors.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven track record of consistently exceeding enterprise sales quotas ($2M+ ARR responsibility) and managing complex, multi-month deal cycles.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Deep understanding of industrial automation, manufacturing workflows, or Robotics-as-a-Service (RaaS) models.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Willingness to travel up to 50-75% within Germany for client meetings, trade shows, onsite evaluations, and international team offsites.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Culture-aligned mindset: Strong ownership mindset, high drive for results, and a pragmatic, solution-oriented working style in a fast-paced scale-up environment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excellent written and verbal communication skills in German and English.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Why join RobCo?</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Develop modular, software-defined robotics solutions with us that set new standards in automation.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Help us build robots equipped with state-of-the-art AI that perceive their environment, analyze data, and make intelligent decisions in real time.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">As part of a very dynamic and fast-growing scale-up, you will take on responsibility from day one, drive your own projects, and see the direct impact of your work.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Flat hierarchies, open communication, and regular 360° feedback enable fast decisions and support your professional and personal development.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Wellpass membership (7,200+ studios across Germany), regular team events, and a team that takes both the work and the culture seriously.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Flexible working hours, a modern office, and—depending on the role—the option to work from home.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Regular team events—from relaxed beer &amp; pizza nights on the rooftop terrace to shared experiences on ski trips or at Oktoberfest.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About RobCo</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Founded in Munich in 2020, RobCo leads the transition toward fully Autonomous Industrial Robotics. Our mission is to deploy RobCo in every factory - solving the industrial labor shortage through end-to-end robotics that just works. Powered by Physical AI, our solutions combine a scalable modular hardware architecture with intelligent software that continuously learns and improves, requiring zero upfront investment through our Robotics-as-a-Service (RaaS) model.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We solve our customers' most pressing pain points - labor shortage, cost pressure, workplace safety, and national reshoring - across the full spectrum of Autonomous Industrial Robotics. In October 2026, RobCo reached unicorn status with a valuation exceeding one billion US dollars, with its valuation doubling in less than nine months. With $200M raised from investors including Sequoia, Lightspeed, Lingotto, Kindred, Cherry Ventures, and the European Tech Collective, 225+ people globally, and 3.5M+ operating hours in the field, we are deploying robots in factories across Europe and the United States - with our US operations headquartered in Austin, TX, and our Bay Area Lab in San Francisco.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Don’t meet every single requirement? If you’re excited about this role but your past experience doesn’t align perfectly with every qualification in the job description, we encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>At RobCo, applicants are selected regardless of ethnic origin, religion, gender, age, disability, or sexual orientation. All decisions throughout the recruitment process are based solely on applicants’ qualifications, skills, knowledge, and experience, as well as relevant business requirements.</em></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/robco/regional-director-of-sales-munich-282413","tags":["Revenue"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Munich","created_at":1794076813},{"slug":"recruiter-commercial-berlin-258857","company_name":"Andercore","title":"Recruiter, Commercial","description":"<h2><strong>About Andercore</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Andercore is the AI-native supplier of industrial materials and goods for energy and infrastructure. We execute trade and distribution end-to-end, on our own account, at the speed of compute - and we are becoming the supplier of record for the entire industry.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Industrial procurement is a €900B market in Europe alone and the largest manual market on earth. 95% of customers have no direct access to global supply chains. Materials pass through four or five intermediaries before they reach a site, and 40% of the margin evaporates on the way. For decades, the operating system of this industry was people: people to source, negotiate, finance, ship, and sell.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We built the alternative from scratch. We are the supplier. We buy from global sources and sell to European customers on our own account. Our AI runs the full trade: sourcing, quality, pricing, sales, logistics, credit, and financing. One request. A firm quote in minutes. Delivered on time. For the customer, it feels like buying from their preferred local supplier. No warehouses. No fleet. No inventory risk. Every trade is pre-sold before it is bought.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are also the credit counterparty. Customers are scored and insured in minutes and get up to 60 days of payment terms priced into the quote itself. The working capital behind every trade is bank-funded, not equity-funded.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Where we are today:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong triple-digit-million euro turnover run rate, the majority of it from repeat customers</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Seven European markets live, sourced from suppliers across Asia and beyond</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">80+ people across Berlin (HQ), London, and Shanghai</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">$90M raised in equity and debt, including our $40M Series B, from Atomico, Project A, Target Global, and Inven Capital - with working capital facilities from UniCredit and KfW</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">The margin is in the bits. The moat is in the atoms. We are building the supplier of record for industrial materials - and redefining how global trade works in one of the largest and most essential industries on earth.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Your mission</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our market moves fast, and so do we. As our business continues to scale, we're looking for an ambitious, German-speaking <strong>Commercial Recruiter</strong> to take ownership of hiring across the DACH region.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll be the driving force behind building our commercial powerhouse — attracting and securing exceptional talent across <strong>Sales, Account Management and Business Development</strong>.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">From the initial hiring kick-off to the final signed contract, you'll own the entire recruitment journey. You'll partner closely with business leaders, shape hiring strategies, identify outstanding talent and turn ambitious growth plans into reality.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This isn't just about filling vacancies. It's about building the people, teams and capabilities that will define our next chapter.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>If you love moving fast, building relationships and making great hires happen, we'd love to meet you.</strong><br /></p><h2><strong>What you'll do</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Own the full cycle:</strong> intake, sourcing, screening, offer, close.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Hunt</strong> passive talent via LinkedIn, referrals, events and direct approach.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Interview</strong> in German and English and deliver sharp shortlists, fast.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Close:</strong> negotiate offers, beat counter-offers, keep candidates warm until day one.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Advise</strong> hiring managers on market, salaries and timelines, and push for quick decisions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Track</strong> everything in Ashby and report on pipeline and time-to-hire.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>You'll thrive here if you have</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Drive and ownership.</strong> Every open role is yours until it's signed.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Curiosity.</strong> You test new channels, tools and outreach, and keep what works.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Hunger to learn.</strong> You want to grow fast with a scale-up where things change weekly.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>What you bring</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluent German (C1 or native) and strong English</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in recruiting (agency or in-house), ideally commercial or sales roles</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven direct sourcing and closing skills</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Bonus</strong>: start-up or scale-up experience, an energy or B2B background, Ashby know-how.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Why Andercore</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Impact:</strong> your hires directly drive our growth</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Growth:</strong> steep learning curve, close to leadership, and a scope that grows with you.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Team:</strong> driven, international, and we celebrate wins together.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Hiring process</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Intro call → Hiring manager interview → Case study → Meet the team → Offer</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Ready to Hunt?</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are an equal-opportunity employer and welcome applicants from all backgrounds, regardless of race, ethnicity, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, age, disability, or any other characteristic. We believe that diversity drives innovation, creativity, and collective strength.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/andercore/recruiter-commercial-berlin-258857","tags":["Talent & HR"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1794076813},{"slug":"remote-founding-account-executive-new-business-406429","company_name":"Fyxer","title":"Founding Account Executive, New Business","description":"<h1>About Fyxer </h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fyxer launched in May 2024 and hit $1M in revenue across 3,000 paid users without spending a dollar on marketing. We've since gone from $1M to $30M ARR and raised a Series B led by Madrona, with Lakestar, 20VC and Marc Benioff behind us.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Far more people start using Fyxer every month than we can speak to. Nobody owns turning those users into paying teams. That's the biggest surface in the company, and it's this seat.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>The role</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">You work accounts where someone is already using the product. One person trying Fyxer is often a door into a 500-person company. Spot those fast, get to the people who sign, prove out the pattern so it repeats.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You run the full cycle. First touch, discovery, demo, pricing, close. No handoffs.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You also write the first version of everything: the pitch, the sequences, the objection handling, the qualification bar. None of it exists yet. What you prove out is what the next reps get trained on.</p><h2><br />What we're looking for</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">High performer, president club pedigree seller who can name 30+ deals you closed yourself in the last 12 months </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excellent communication and interpersonal skills, with the ability to build and maintain relationships with stakeholders at all levels of an organization</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You've worked without a playbook, or built one where none existed</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">Three years in or twelve. We care what you've done, not where you did it.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>How we work</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Time with customers is the only thing that compounds. Everything else is overhead. We automate the research, the notes, the CRM and the follow-up with our own product. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We move fast and decide in the meeting. You own your outcomes. We challenge each other directly. It's intense and it isn't for everyone.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br /><strong>The Fyxer Reality: Why We Win</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>The Trajectory:</strong> We grew from $1M to $30M ARR with a team of just 32. </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>The Evidence:</strong> Ranked <strong>7th in Andreessen Horowitz’s list of top AI apps</strong>. Every other company in that top 10 is valued at $10B+. We are the outlier.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>The Culture of Agency:</strong> We hire exceptional people, give them total ownership, and get out of their way.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Zero Bureaucracy:</strong> No slow-motion decision-making. No "alignment" meetings for the sake of it.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">This culture is intense; it requires focus and discipline. So we’ll do everything we can to remove distraction, support your wellbeing, and reward your impact <br /></p><h2>The basics</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Remote, US</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Compensation: $100K base / $200K OTE (plus equity, depending on location)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Uncapped with accelerators above 100%. Reports to Alec Kraft, VP of Sales</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Travel: Occasional for enterprise customers</p></li></ul><hr><p>Compensation: $90K – $100K • Offers Equity • Offers Bonus • $180-200 OTE 50/50 split. Uncapped with accelerators above 100%</p><ul><li> • $90K – $100K • Offers Equity • Offers Bonus • $180-200 OTE 50/50 split. Uncapped with accelerators above 100%</li></ul><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/fyxer/remote-founding-account-executive-new-business-406429","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Remote","created_at":1794076812},{"slug":"head-of-operations-berlin-100938","company_name":"Prior Labs","title":"Head of Operations","description":"<h2>Who we are</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Foundation models transformed text and images. Structured data - the largest and most consequential data format in the world - stayed untouched, until now. What LLMs did for language, we're doing for tables.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We pioneered tabular foundation models: TabPFN v2 was a <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-024-08328-6">Nature</a> cover story, has passed 3.5M+ downloads and 7,500+ GitHub stars, and runs in production from <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://www.oxcan.org/news/prior-labs-and-oxford-cancer-analytics-partner-to-advance-liquid-biopsy-and-clinical-decision-making-in-lung-disease">detecting lung disease with Oxford Cancer Analytics</a> to <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://siliconangle.com/2025/12/01/prior-labs-debuts-tabular-ai-foundation-model-scales-10-million-rows/">preventing train failures with Hitachi</a>. The hardest problems - millions of rows, real-time inference, entirely new modalities - are still open, and no one else is working on them at this level.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're a <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://priorlabs.ai/about">small, highly selective team of 40+</a> with backgrounds from Google, DeepMind, Meta, Apple, Amazon, Jane Street, and CERN, led by <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/frank-hutter-9190b24b/">Frank Hutter</a>, <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/noah-hollmann-668b9010b/">Noah Hollmann</a>, and <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/sauraj-g/">Sauraj Gambhir</a>, and advised by Bernhard Schölkopf and Turing Award winner Yann LeCun.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">In July 2026, less than 18 months after our €9M pre-seed, we <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://priorlabs.ai/blog-posts/priorlabs-sap">joined SAP</a> as an independent frontier AI lab - same team, mission, and open-weights models, now backed by more than €1 billion over four years.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>The Role</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">The Head of Operations reports to Sauraj (Co-CEO, GTM and Operations) and take ownership of operational excellence company-wide. As Finance, Legal, People, IT and InfoSec, and Compliance grow into their own functions, this person partners with each lead on the operational side of their work and holds the whole together as one system. They lead the operations team and grow it into one fit for a company many times our current size.</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Builds the operating engine for growth and scale.</strong> Owns how the company runs operationally and designs the processes that hold up as headcount, revenue, and complexity grow fast. Everything breaks at each new stage of growth; this person sees it coming and rebuilds ahead of the curve so operations never becomes the ceiling on how fast we can move.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Drives operational excellence across every function.</strong> Accountable for the operational side of finance, people, legal, and the wider back office, with IT, InfoSec, and compliance covered through the relevant leads. You will set the standard and makes sure nothing important falls between functions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Brings order to ambiguity.</strong> Takes the most complex, cross-functional problems and drives them to resolution bringing all the right stakeholder to the table, motivating and inspiring them to come together and deliver the project for everyone’s benefit.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Is a decision partner.</strong> Frames trade-offs, surfaces risk early, and turns decisions into action, so the leadership team works from reliable data and sound judgment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Builds and inspires the operations team.</strong> Hires, develops, and leads an operations team people want to be part of, and sets a standard of execution that raises the bar for everyone who works with them.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Who we're looking for</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Essential:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>High-growth experience above all.</strong> Has operated inside a company through rapid scaling, seen what breaks at each stage, and built the processes and structures that scaled through it. This is the most important thing we are looking for.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Global operating experience.</strong> Has run operations across multiple countries and regions, comfortable holding a company together across time zones and jurisdictions, not just in a single market.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Broad operations ownership.</strong> Has driven operational excellence across two or more of finance, people, legal, and business operations as a senior generalist, partnering with specialist leads rather than owning their decisions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A leader operators want to follow.</strong> Builds and develops strong teams and is the kind of person other excellent operators want to come and work with.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A big plus:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in the data, developer tools, or AI market, and comfort working credibly with a technical, research-led team</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Has built an operations function that grew with a company from startup into real scale</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What makes someone thrive here:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Energized by building the systems that unlock the next stage of growth, not by maintaining the status quo</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Radical ownership: runs at the most difficult problems and resolves them rather than passing them up</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Practical and pragmatic: builds processes that scale without bloat, using as much structure as the moment needs</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Calm and decisive under ambiguity and competing priorities, and sets that standard for the team</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Location</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ideally this person will be located at one of our hubs in New York or Berlin. In exceptional circumstances, we will be able to consider remote/hybrid applications.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>Life at Prior Labs</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll work alongside researchers and builders who hold themselves to a very high bar - in the quality of their work and in how they work with each other. We move fast and still take the time to do things right.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our teams are based in Berlin, Freiburg, and New York - when you're working on something as hard as TabPFN, being in the same room matters. But great people come from everywhere, and in exceptional cases we're open to remote, which usually means frequent travel to one of our offices. Wherever you're based, the whole company comes together regularly for offsites to build and celebrate together.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>Our Commitments</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">The best products and teams are built by people with a wide range of perspectives and backgrounds. We welcome applications from all identities and walks of life - especially if you've ever felt discouraged by "not checking every box" - and provide equal opportunities regardless of gender, sexual orientation, origin, disability, or any other trait that makes you who you are.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We care about how your data is handled - see our <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://priorlabs.ai/recruiting-data-privacy">Recruiting Data Privacy</a> page</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/prior-labs/head-of-operations-berlin-100938","tags":["Operations"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1794076812},{"slug":"produktentwickler-frische-visbek-253544","company_name":"Plukon Food Group Germany","title":"Produktentwickler (m/w/d) Frische","description":"<p style="text-align:start;">Zur Verstärkung unseres Teams an unserem Standort in&nbsp;<strong>Visbek</strong>&nbsp;<span style="color:#121317">suchen wir zum nächstmöglichen</span><span style="color:#E50101">&nbsp;</span><span style="color:#121317">Zeitpunkt einen </span><strong>Produktentwickler (m/w/d) Frische</strong></p><h2 style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="color:#0A8B42">Informationen über unseren Betrieb</span></strong></h2><p>In Visbek befindet sich das Herzstück der Plukon Food Group in Deutschland. Hier sind gleich drei wesentliche Bestandteile unserer Unternehmensgruppe ansässig: Die Plukon GmbH ist die deutsche Verwaltungszentrale von Plukon. Von hieraus steuern Management und Verwaltung die Geschäftsaktivitäten. Ebenfalls am niedersächsischen Standort angesiedelt ist die Plukon Visbek GmbH. Hier handelt es sich um einen Geflügel-Verarbeitungsbetrieb, der auf die Herstellung tiefgekühlter Convenience-Produkte spezialisiert ist. Last but not least hat auch die Plukon Agri GmbH in Visbek ihren Sitz.&nbsp;Plukon Agri ist als Partner unserer Landwirte für den Verkauf von Eintagsküken und den Einkauf von Schlachtgeflügel zuständig.</p><h2 style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="color:#0A8B42">Deine Tätigkeiten:&nbsp;</span></strong></h2><ul><li><p>Entwicklung neuer Produkte von der Rohware bis zum Endprodukt</p></li><li><p>Bearbeitung / Erstellung von Musteranfragen / Mustern</p></li><li><p>Begleitung von Erstproduktionen und Linientests</p></li><li><p>Rezepturmanagement und Projektdokumentation</p></li><li><p>Organisation und Prüfung neuer Zutaten</p></li><li><p>Bearbeitung von Spezifikationen (Rohwaren, Endartikel)</p></li><li><p>Aktualisieren der bereits bestehenden Produktionsprozesse und -abläufe</p></li><li><p>Prozess- und Produktoptimierung im Rahmen von Neuentwicklungen</p></li><li><p>Deklarationsprüfung</p></li><li><p>Zusammenarbeit mit Laboren und Forschungseinrichtungen</p></li></ul><h2 style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="color:#0A8B42">Diese Qualifikationen solltest Du mitbringe