knowledge</strong> across every workflow stage so the team scales without losing context.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Lead product marketing rollouts:</strong> internally with sales and ops enablement (Notion, Loom, live sessions) and externally through newsletters and feature announcements to clients and prospects.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2>We would love to work with you if</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have solid PM craft on both <strong>discovery and delivery</strong>, with strong opinions on what makes a product succeed.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are <strong>data-fluent</strong>: comfortable writing SQL, you understand SaaS fundamentals, and you use AI tools daily to boost your output.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You think <strong>business first</strong>: you start with the "why", stay close to commercial reality, and make pragmatic trade-offs.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You thrive in <strong>early-stage chaos</strong>: high ownership, high autonomy, and excellent cross-functional collaboration and communication.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are <strong>structured and rigorous</strong> in how you write specs, document decisions, and run delivery.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are <strong>fluent in English</strong> (working language).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Bonus:</em> knowledge of product-based AI agents, excellent writing skills, and hands-on experience with MVP tools (Lovable, etc.).</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2>Hiring Process</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">1️⃣ <strong>Screening call </strong>with Pierre (Talent Acquisition Partner) - 45 min </p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>2️⃣ Hiring Manager Itw </strong>with Charles (Head of Product) - 45min</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">3️⃣<strong> 