ofollow" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/mob-control/id1562817072"><strong><u>Mob Control</u></strong></a><strong>.</strong><br /></p><h1><strong>Role</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will be responsible for crafting visually compelling, gameplay-driven 3D ad creatives using Unreal Engine. From concept to final render, you'll have full ownership of the production pipeline.<br /></p><h1><strong>Challenges</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Create eye-catching 3D mobile ad creatives that clearly communicate gameplay and drive performance</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build and animate complete scenes in Unreal Engine: characters, environments, VFX, lighting</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Use Blueprint scripting and/or code (C++) to simulate gameplay logic, interactions, and camera behaviors</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Translate and adapt ad concepts, animations into Unreal Engine with high fidelity</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Take ownership of the entire ad creation pipeline: from ideation and scene setup to rendering and final polish</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Apply storytelling and visual clarity to highlight core gameplay loops within 20–30 second formats</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Collaborate with Creative and UA teams to test, learn, and iterate quickly<br /></p></li></ul><h1><strong>Profile</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong generalist skills in Unreal Engine: modeling, texturing, lighting, animation, and rendering</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proficient in Blueprint scripting and familiar with coding (C++ or similar) for scene logic and behavior</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proficient with After Effects</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong user of AI pipelines</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong background creating performance marketing ads in Unreal Engine</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Understanding of mobile ad performance metrics like CTR, CPI, and ROAS</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable working with optimized assets and keeping performance constraints in mind</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with Blender, Maya and animation tools are nice to have </p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/voodoo/unreal-engine-motion-designer-mob-control-paris-95592","tags":["Growth"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Paris","created_at":1794098411},{"slug":"game-developer-midcore-games-paris-455470","company_name":"Voodoo","title":"Game Developer - Midcore Games","description":"<h1>About Voodoo</h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">Voodoo is a consumer tech company founded in Paris in 2013, with one mission: entertain the world. Today we are 1,000 people, generating $1b+ in annual revenue, profitably. Our games and apps have passed 7 billion downloads and reach 200 million+ active users every month, making Voodoo the #3 mobile publisher worldwide in downloads, after Google and Meta. We were backed by Goldman Sachs, Tencent and GBL along the way.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This position is ideally Paris-based, Beijing- based or Warsaw-based, with relocation support available.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1>Team</h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will be an integral part of a newly established internal studio, a dynamic and focused team dedicated to one of our most promising prototype in scale. This studio is specifically chartered to improve this high-potential game up to the successful and market-ready title it is meant to become. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">In this exciting role, your initial focus will be on one of our new Midcore Games that have already demon