yle="min-height:1.5em">Define how Neural Concept’s technology is positioned across personas, industries, and use cases.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ensure consistency and clarity across all market-facing materials (website, flagship assets, campaigns).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Clearly articulate technical differentiation and competitive positioning in a factual, grounded way.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Content Strategy &amp; Creation</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own and produce technology- and product-driven content across flagship assets (hero blogs, whitepapers, product pages, decks).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Translate ongoing technical innovation into concrete, high-quality content that can be used externally by customers, partners, and sales teams.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with the Design team to shape and produce high-quality product and technology content, including diagrams, visual explanations, demos and videos.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Go-to-Market Foundations (in collaboration)</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Produce use-case content, value stories, and messaging inputs that Sales Enablement and Marketing actively use in customer conversations and campaigns.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Collaborate with Sales Enablement to ensure product and technology narratives are translated into clear, consistent sales messaging.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support entry into new industries or use cases by clarifying positioning and value stories, without owning sales strategy or execution.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Cross-functional Collaboration</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner closely with Product, Applied Engineering, Sales Enablement, Marketing, and Leadership.</p></li><li><p styl