al discussions and asking the right questions to build accurate, credible market narratives.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluent in English, written and spoken.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Ways of working</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Able to drive complex topics from exploration to execution.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Able to operate with a high degree of autonomy while staying closely aligned with leadership and peers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Execution-oriented, pragmatic, and hands-on.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Open, direct, and collaborative in working across functions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Energized by a fast-paced, ever-changing environment. You adapt quickly, stay ahead of change, and are willing to challenge your own choices and iterate on them.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Genuine passion for technology, engineering, innovation, and AI. You naturally follow what’s happening in the field, enjoy exploring how new technologies change the way products are designed, and have a strong appetite for learning and continuous improvement.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proactive and eager to step in beyond the core scope when projects call for it, contributing to product-related communications such as events, press releases, website updates, or newsletters.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>What you get </strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with a world-class technology team – our engineers are top-notch, and we always aim for excellence. </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Benefit from a competitive salary and rewarding opportunities as we continue to scale. </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Thrive in a collaborative, multicultural environment where your work is visible and recognized. </p></li><li><p sty