&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder-management skills, including the confidence to work with engineers, managers, and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sense of ownership and accountability, with a proactive and hands-on approach to solving problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify risks, communicate challenges transparently, and escalate issues when necessary rather than waiting for problems to resolve themselves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly learn new technologies, processes, and technical environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High energy, adaptability, and a strong “can-do” mentality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively both independently and as part of a multidisciplinary team.&lt;/li&gt;
