ology, Data &amp; AI, Digital Commerce, Customer Experience, and Business Transformation initiatives.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Manage assigned workstreams or smaller projects, ensuring delivery against agreed scope, timelines, quality, and budget.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Develop and maintain project plans, delivery schedules, RAID logs (Risks, Assumptions, Issues, Dependencies), status reports, and project documentation.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Monitor project progress, identify delivery risks and dependencies, and proactively escalate issues where required.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Coordinate project activities across multidisciplinary teams to ensure effective execution and delivery.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Build strong working relationships with client stakeholders, project teams, and internal delivery functions.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Support governance activities including project reporting, steering committee preparation, action tracking, and decision management.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Facilitate project meetings, workshops, sprint ceremonies, and status reviews.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Ensure clear communication of project progress, milestones, risks, issues, and decisions to relevant stakeholders.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Support change management and business readiness activities throughout the project lifecycle.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Work closely with Product Managers, Business Analysts, Business Technology consultants, Scrum Masters, Architects, Engineers, Designers, and client stakeholders to coordinate successful delivery.</p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Contribute to Agile delivery by supporting sprint planning, backlog reviews, retrospectives, release planning, and dependency management.<