set, and trialling new propositions at pace.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You speak Dutch and fluent English. Other European languages will also be an asset.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>What you will be doing</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Owning Axle’s commercial results in the Dutch market: pipeline, revenue and partner success</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Winning new customers end-to-end, from first conversation through to commercial close, and setting partners up to generate meaningful revenue</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Driving go-to-market execution with partners, including value propositions, pricing, customer segmentation and launch strategy</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Building the zero-to-one of the business through partnerships. You’ll be on the phone (and eventually on the ground) with utilities/retailers, potential clients and grid operators, creating and disproving hypotheses as quickly as possible</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Continuing to sharpen our view of where the value is and which markets and business models are accessible to us</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Building lasting relationships with grid operators and the regulator, so that Axle is well positioned as the market evolves</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Acting as the conduit between partners and engineering, creating fast, structured feedback loops that turn field insights into product improvements</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">As such, we are looking for a “full-stack operator” who can process highly technical information, ramp up commercial value, and accelerate us into new markets.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You might have previous experience in one or more of the activities above, but we are more interested in your growth potential than your domain-specific expertise. We are looking for people who have built things, developed new relationships